Package: deppo
Architecture: any
Depends:
 fuse3,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Linux client for Deppo storage
 Deppo backs up folders to Deppo cloud storage and can mount the
 subscription as a FUSE filesystem showing the current version of each
 file. Configuration lives under ~/.config/deppo; one background process
 runs per user.
 .
 This package installs the deppo binary. Optional login startup is set
 with "deppo enable-startup" (systemd --user).
 .
 Supported Ubuntu releases start at 22.04 LTS (jammy), matching the
 distro rustc 1.75 toolchain used to build the package.
